flowchart TB
  rec["<b>A walk-through in Sinhala</b><br/>“මේ තියෙන්නේ ප්‍රධාන ස්විච් පෙට්ටිය.”"]:::person
  wav["<b>FFmpeg</b> · 16 kHz mono WAV"]:::code
  vad["<b>Cut at pauses</b> · media/vad.py<br/>pieces of at most 28 s, under the model's 40 s limit;<br/>each piece keeps its own start and end time"]:::code

  subgraph SVC["services/sinhala-asr · a small FastAPI service · a token on every request"]
    direction TB
    asr["<b>Omnilingual ASR</b> · Meta's open weights, self-hosted<br/>omniASR_LLM_1B_v2 on a GPU, told the language (sin_Sinh)<br/>omniASR_CTC_1B_v2 on a CPU"]:::open
    zwj["<b>Code</b> puts back the zero-width joiner that the<br/>tokenizer writes as ⁇ : චිත් ⁇ රපට becomes චිත්‍රපට"]:::code
    asr --> zwj
  end

  guard{{"<b>Code:</b> are at least half<br/>of the letters Sinhala?"}}:::code
